## @file
#  FuzzContextLib - Single fuzz byte pool for HBFAplus.
#
#  Owns the process-lifetime MOCK_FUZZ_CONTEXT that every consumer shares.
#  ToolChainHarnessLib loads it per iteration; mocks, RegisterFilterLib, and
#  harness code all consume from the same pool.
